# ============================================================
# STEP 8 — AFP RESPONSE
# ============================================================

Use ONLY the strict structured AFP phenotype.

Pre-TACE AFP:
nearest in −30..0d.

Reassessment AFP:
nearest within ±14d of reassessment.

Report:
- baseline availability
- reassessment availability
- paired availability

Calculate:
`delta_log_AFP = log(AFP_reassessment+1) - log(AFP_preTACE+1)`

Also report descriptive:
- ≥50% fall
- 20–49% fall
- stable
- rise

Only calculate relative change when baseline AFP is sufficiently elevated.

Do not force relative change on AFP-low/nonsecretor disease.

