# STEP 9 — BUILD THE CLINICAL EQUIPOISE FUNNEL
# ============================================================

Starting from patients with an interpretable reassessment:

Print one attrition waterfall:

INDEX TACE
→ reassessment imaging
→ residual/recurrent viable HCC
→ no definite extrahepatic spread
→ no clearly prohibitive macrovascular invasion
→ hepatic reserve compatible with active treatment
→ performance status compatible where known
→ no immediate curative surgery/transplant pathway
→ clinically plausible candidate for repeat TACE OR systemic escalation

IMPORTANT:

Do not invent a single rigid "eligible" rule without printing it.

Create at least:

### Broad equipoise phenotype
Liver-dominant active HCC, no obvious absolute contraindication to either strategy.

### Strict equipoise phenotype
- liver-confined
- no main portal-vein invasion
- no overt decompensation
- ALBI/mALBI within a clinically defensible range
- ECOG 0–1 where known
- residual disease technically plausible for another TACE

The strict phenotype may require human confirmation of technical TACE suitability.

Print N removed at every step and reason.

